<title>USA: True North unit buys Indian firm Ulka.</title>
<headline>True North unit buys Indian firm Ulka.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foote, Cone &amp; Belding, a unit of True North Communications Inc, said Friday it has completed the acquisition of Ulka Advertising of India.</p>
<p>Financial terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Ulka, which will be renamed FCB/Ulka, is India's fifth largest agency with projected 1997 billings of $120 million Foote, Cone &amp; Belding said.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
